; ..\_01_BSW\Src\PduR\PduR_RmTp_TxInst.c	   100  /*! \brief      This function triggers the reception in an upper layer module in case of an
; ..\_01_BSW\Src\PduR\PduR_RmTp_TxInst.c	   101   *              1:N routing including an upper layer module StartOfReception/ CopyRxData/
